    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, people say that, but they dont get it. it's not just a \"bad mood\" or being overwhelmed. it's the sheer scale of the loss. it's like everything i built, everything beautiful, is just being erased by time or rot or whatever. it feels so futile to just keep breathing through the decay. isn't there something more dignified than just sitting here waiting for the end to swallow everything?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
